      "id": "claim_28f09d37a89f41b9b866497746ba8136",
      "statement": "Each studio has one new-client admission mode (open, waitlist or closed) that never governs existing clients' booking, portal access or rebooking, and an unreadable mode is treated as a refusal rather than as open.",
